      "text": "Using the difference of squares:\n\n\\[\n(2^{1004}+5^{1005})^2-(2^{1004}-5^{1005})^2\n=4(2^{1004})(5^{1005})\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=4\\cdot 2^{1004}\\cdot 5^{1005}\n=2^{1006}\\cdot 5^{1005}\n=2\\cdot 10^{1005}\n=20\\cdot 10^{1004}\n\\]\n\nThus \\(k=20\\).\n\nThe answer is 20.",
